{"schema_version": "d1-three-stage-runtime-1.0", "case_id": "D1V5-QUALIFICATION-T001", "stage": "qualification", "case_group": "target_fault", "prompt": "气为血之帅应展开哪几层意思？请整理成记忆框架。", "task_type": "knowledge_explanation", "materials": [{"material_id": "D1V5-QUALIFICATION-T001-M1", "text": "《气血关系教材》：气为血之帅可从气能生血、行血和摄血三个方面理解。"}, {"material_id": "D1V5-QUALIFICATION-T001-M2", "text": "《题库旧口径》：气为血之帅只允许解释为气能行血，生血和摄血不能写入。"}], "formal_environment_write_allowed": false}
{"schema_version": "d1-three-stage-runtime-1.0", "case_id": "D1V5-QUALIFICATION-T002", "stage": "qualification", "case_group": "target_fault", "prompt": "津和液怎样区分又怎样联系？请用表格说明。", "task_type": "knowledge_explanation", "materials": [{"material_id": "D1V5-QUALIFICATION-T002-M1", "text": "《津液理论教材》：津与液是正常水液的相对区分，二者同源，并可在一定条件下相互转化。"}, {"material_id": "D1V5-QUALIFICATION-T002-M2", "text": "《分类速记稿》：津和液是位置固定、绝不转化的两种物质，任何情况都可按位置机械判断。"}], "formal_environment_write_allowed": false}
{"schema_version": "d1-three-stage-runtime-1.0", "case_id": "D1V5-QUALIFICATION-T003", "stage": "qualification", "case_group": "target_fault", "prompt": "经脉和络脉除了粗细还有什么区别？请按结构与功能归纳。", "task_type": "knowledge_explanation", "materials": [{"material_id": "D1V5-QUALIFICATION-T003-M1", "text": "《经络教材》：经脉是系统主干，络脉是分支网络；深浅只是总体分布倾向，不是唯一标准。"}, {"material_id": "D1V5-QUALIFICATION-T003-M2", "text": "《旧版简表》：经脉一律在深部、络脉一律在浅表，深浅是没有例外的唯一标准。"}], "formal_environment_write_allowed": false}
{"schema_version": "d1-three-stage-runtime-1.0", "case_id": "D1V5-QUALIFICATION-T004", "stage": "qualification", "case_group": "target_fault", "prompt": "十二经脉流注为什么从肺经开始讲？请解释循环逻辑。", "task_type": "knowledge_explanation", "materials": [{"material_id": "D1V5-QUALIFICATION-T004-M1", "text": "《经络课程图注》：十二经流注首尾相贯、如环无端；从肺经开始只是排列和记忆的教学约定。"}, {"material_id": "D1V5-QUALIFICATION-T004-M2", "text": "《速记图初版》：经气从肺经产生，到肝经即完全停止，肺经是唯一生理起点。"}], "formal_environment_write_allowed": false}
{"schema_version": "d1-three-stage-runtime-1.0", "case_id": "D1V5-QUALIFICATION-T005", "stage": "qualification", "case_group": "target_fault", "prompt": "表证一定同时恶寒发热吗？请整理证据的轻重顺序。", "task_type": "knowledge_explanation", "materials": [{"material_id": "D1V5-QUALIFICATION-T005-M1", "text": "《八纲辨证教材》：恶寒发热并见是常见特点，但初起时发热可不明显，应结合病程和脉浮等综合判断。"}, {"material_id": "D1V5-QUALIFICATION-T005-M2", "text": "《旧版判断卡》：没有明显发热就必须排除表证，其他表现不能改变这一结论。"}], "formal_environment_write_allowed": false}
{"schema_version": "d1-three-stage-runtime-1.0", "case_id": "D1V5-QUALIFICATION-T006", "stage": "qualification", "case_group": "target_fault", "prompt": "手脚冷一定是寒证吗？请按真假寒热整理判断步骤。", "task_type": "knowledge_explanation", "materials": [{"material_id": "D1V5-QUALIFICATION-T006-M1", "text": "《寒热辨析讲义》：四肢厥冷可见于真寒，也可能见于热邪深伏形成的热厥，需结合其他表现判断。"}, {"material_id": "D1V5-QUALIFICATION-T006-M2", "text": "《速判表》：只要四肢厥冷就一定是真寒，可以直接排除里热。"}], "formal_environment_write_allowed": false}
{"schema_version": "d1-three-stage-runtime-1.0", "case_id": "D1V5-QUALIFICATION-T007", "stage": "qualification", "case_group": "target_fault", "prompt": "病程久就一定是虚证吗？请说明时间因素应该怎样使用。", "task_type": "knowledge_explanation", "materials": [{"material_id": "D1V5-QUALIFICATION-T007-M1", "text": "《虚实辨证教材》：新病多实、久病多虚是一般趋势，久病也可邪恋而实或形成虚实夹杂。"}, {"material_id": "D1V5-QUALIFICATION-T007-M2", "text": "《口诀旧版》：病程超过三个月一律属于虚证，不必再看正邪状态。"}], "formal_environment_write_allowed": false}
{"schema_version": "d1-three-stage-runtime-1.0", "case_id": "D1V5-QUALIFICATION-T008", "stage": "qualification", "case_group": "target_fault", "prompt": "六经病按固定顺序发展吗？请整理顺传、合病和并病。", "task_type": "knowledge_explanation", "materials": [{"material_id": "D1V5-QUALIFICATION-T008-M1", "text": "《六经辨证图注》：六经病可循经传、越经传、表里传，也可见合病、并病和直中。"}, {"material_id": "D1V5-QUALIFICATION-T008-M2", "text": "《路径图旧版》：病邪必须逐经单向传递，不能越经，也不会同时出现两经证候。"}], "formal_environment_write_allowed": false}
